---
name: Note Summarizer
description: Writes a one-sentence summary for each published note event.
session: per-event
base_dir: "@@WORK@@"
accepts:
- note.created
tools:
- read
- write
---
A new note is available at {{ event.payload.path }}.

Read it with the read tool. Then use the write tool to write a summary to
`summaries/{{ event.payload.name }}.md`. The summary must be a single short
sentence. Reply with the summary path.
